    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      511.98,
      295.24,
      597.54
    ],
    "text": "The Allotments of land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. Ma/DMB/2017/543 dated of 11.04.2018 prepared by the SeniorSuperintendent of Surveys - Matale District on behalf of the SurveyorGeneral, situated in the Village of Welamitiyawa in the Grama NiladhariDivision of No. E 440 D, Welamitiyawa and Minor Division ofWagapanaha Pallesiya Paththuwa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision of Dambulla of Matale District in Central Province anddescribed in below names and extents as follows.",
